+// code references, for a build without the inspector (USE_INSPECTOR_STUB).
+//
+// No frontend ever connects: nothing in the build creates an inspector frontend or a remote inspection
+// target. Each controller keeps the instrumenting agents the instrumentation hooks read and no agents, so
+// the hooks find no agent to call. Queries answer as they do with no frontend connected, the page and
+// frame lifecycle members release what the controllers hold, and every member that serves a frontend or
+// a canvas recording is a release assertion.
+
